    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i just sit here and think about how much more peaceful it would be if i didn't have to fight this every morning. if i could just... stop. if i could just go where he is. it feels like the only way the silence wouldn't be so heavy is if i wasn't here to hear it. does that even make sense? that it feels like a relief to just think about not being in this anymore?",
